legal=grounding('Initialize three MemoryStorage instances with the same index-1/term-1 snapshot and voters 1,2,3, HardState commit=1 and Applied=1, following recommended snapshot bootstrap. Campaign through public RawNode and deliver actual messages. Propose JointImplicit removal of 3; when leader receives that committed entry in Ready, request transfer to 2 before applying and advancing the entry. This preserves the investigated overlap. Process each Ready synchronously: persist, queue messages, apply configuration, Advance. FIFO transport drops only genuine MsgTimeoutNow according to the policy chosen before the run. No source state is altered. Tick all three nodes, drain all Ready and messages, observe after ten ticks and again after ten more. The latter ten-step schedule is indefinitely repeatable if behavior state repeats; no exit deadline is inferred from its length.')
