plan=dict(description='Check C-auto-exit-continuation by comparing exact serialized protocol/storage state at the same schedule phase after transfer abort and after ten fair tick-and-drain iterations. Admission is the actual application of the implicit configuration during transfer. A repeated state with AutoLeave still set is a closed non-exiting suffix, not merely bounded waiting. The full delivery trace and follower heartbeat counts expose the executed suffix.',claim_id='C-auto-exit-continuation',binding_ids=bids,harness=dict(kind='go_test',source='',files={},description='Single-threaded RawNode harness using actual emitted messages and MemoryStorage; direct read-only reflection captures all RawNode/raft/log/tracker fields and MemoryStorage data at drained boundaries. No target implementation is replaced.',semantic_changes=['No target code edits or behavior instrumentation. Controlled FIFO network may drop TimeoutNow only.','One public TransferLeader call is interleaved after committed configuration delivery and before ApplyConfChange/Advance.','Reflection records unexported state without invoking methods; excludes logger/traceLogger, duplicate Storage interface, MemoryStorage mutex and call statistics. MemoryStorage contents are captured separately. Function code identities are recorded; bound raft owner is the same node throughout.','Nil versus empty maps/slices and slice capacities are preserved; map entries are canonicalized by key. Pointer allocation addresses are omitted because the suffix does not branch on them.','Clock, driver diagnostic counters and recorded output are not fed back to protocol. The fixed schedule phase, transport policy, injected flag, operation identity and queue are captured.'],prerequisites=prereqs,legality=legal),monitors=[dict(id='M-auto-exit-cycle',checker_id='P-no-pending-cycle',event='cycle_result',binding_ids=bids,grounding=grounding('The serialized state covers all behavior-determining mutable state under this schedule. A comparison to the correlated start snapshot is independently encoded as the implication antecedent; the required consequent is AutoLeave=false. Missing or unequal state cannot supply a violating witness. Healthy heartbeat delivery and lack of pending work must be checked against the raw trace and captured fields during correspondence.'),admission_alias='admitted',applicability_conditions=[eq('policy','drop_timeout_now')])],observable_properties=[dict(checker_id='P-no-pending-cycle',kind='event_implication',trigger=eq('policy','drop_timeout_now'),antecedent=ref('state','start.state'),assertion=eq('auto_leave',False),identity_fields=['op_id','node','change_index'],description='For the admitted automatic-exit operation after transfer abort, identical protocol/storage/queue state after one full fair suffix implies the automatic joint state cannot remain pending. If state differs, this finite comparison only excludes this cycle witness; it does not establish eventual exit.')],uncertainties=['Fresh execution must establish the encoded observations; local compilation is not Evidence.','Repeatability depends on the source-supported exclusion of logging, storage call statistics, mutex internals, pointer allocation identities and the global election RNG. The suffix never reaches an election or reset; randomized timeout fields are included and follower elapsed time is reset by each heartbeat.','Exact endpoint comparison alone would be insufficient under hidden callbacks or asynchronous IO; this harness deliberately uses serialized RawNode, synchronous MemoryStorage and completed Advance, with no external goroutines or callbacks.','This single legal history does not cover every configuration, async IO mode, successful transfer or endpoint application.'])
